Derived files
  data/questions.json    - statement wording and level structure derived from 12axes questions.js.
                           Levels were re-indexed (see scripts/extract-12axes.mjs); no axis was
                           reversed relative to the upstream source.
  data/ideologies.json   - ideology names, Wikipedia links, descriptions and four-axis positions
                           derived from 12axes ideologies.js.
  data/axes.json         - the seven-step labels per axis (labels_en) derived from the
                           aArray..lArray definitions in 12axes results.html. Axis and pole names
                           follow the canonical ordering defined in docs/data-contract.md.

Modifications
  - The upstream "dipl" (diplomatic) coordinate is remapped to the internationalist-nationalist
    axis. In the upstream site it is compared against the Globalism/Protectionism axis; this
    project treats it as the Internationalist/Nationalist axis instead. Values are not transformed.
  - Upstream pole names and axis labels were normalised to the canonical naming in this project.
  - Chinese (zh) translations of names, labels, descriptions and questions are original work
    by the kioo project contributors and are not part of the upstream data.
  - Only the data files listed above are derived; the upstream code, styling and images are
    not included.
